data/grimes-mahto-2026-data-s1/: supplementary material (Data S1) to Grimes DR, Mahto A.
J Cosmet Dermatol 2026;25(10):e71208, doi:10.1111/jocd.71208, an open-access article published under
CC BY 4.0. Reproduced unmodified with attribution to the original authors.

data/batool-2026/figure-values.csv: values transcribed from Figures 5 and 8 of Batool A, et al.
J Cosmet Dermatol 2026;25(7):e71041, doi:10.1111/jocd.71041 (open access, CC BY 4.0).

data/corrected/: the Notes, sponsor and other descriptive columns are copied verbatim from Data S1
(Grimes and Mahto); only the values listed in corrections/corrections.csv were changed.
